   <p class="fx-p rv" style="--d:.55s">Café, kitchen, bar and banquet at Capital Park, Madhapur.</p>
   <div class="fx-btns rv" style="--d:.7s"><button class="fk-btn fk-btn--primary fk-btn--md pill" type="button" data-open="book">Reserve a table <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button><a class="fk-btn fk-btn--secondary fk-btn--md fx-ghost" href="/menu">Explore the menu <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
  </div>

  <aside class="fx-info rv" style="--d:1.05s" aria-label="Visit Fursat"><i class="fi-d" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="fi-a"><b>Last table {slots[slots.length - 1].time}</b><small>Capital Park, Madhapur · {site.phone}</small></span></aside>


  
 </div>
  <div class="fxs-wrap" id="fxsw" inert aria-hidden="true">
   <figure class="fxs-tile"><img src="/assets/dishes/new/fursat-rahasyam-480.webp" width="480" height="720" alt="Fursat Rahasyam, a layered house cocktail" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure>
